  "_comment": "🧩️ This subset's own contribution to the repository test platform, distinct from the shared ✏️s/🔌️plugins/🗄️stdio/🧪️oracle/🔣️.json manifest: that file registers the `png` reference crate under the `png-raster` capability its own create-and-round-trip-png case exercises; this file registers the SAME package under a distinct id and the `png-1-2-mutate` capability this subset's exhaustive mutation case (`mutate-png-1-2`) actually tags, per the wave 7 fleet brief's oracle-registration gotcha (reusing the shared entry fails the contract with `oracle-capability-mismatch`).",
